    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features various enemies and characters from other NecroCatic Games' releases such as &quot;The Tower of Wowers&quot;, &quot;CarsFuckingDragons&quot; and &quot;Grand Strokers&quot; in a brand spankin' new adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has some throw back maps and is a stand alone game set in the NecroCatic World. We hope you enjoy!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Two dozen different characters to recruit and find!! You may recognize some of them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Tons of enemies and bosses to fight hand-drawn by Cesare from Italy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A digital metric poop ton of armor and weapons to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Traditional turn-based combat with new and clearly superior <strong>Retro Sideview Combat</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Open World Exploration with many maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Another Dragon Strip Club!! You read that right! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Day/night cycle with the hour, day, week, month and even year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022In-game weather system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Chase events...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features various enemies and characters from other NecroCatic Games' releases such as &quot;The Tower of Wowers&quot;, &quot;CarsFuckingDragons&quot; and &quot;Grand Strokers&quot; in a brand spankin' new adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has some throw back maps and is a stand alone game set in the NecroCatic World. We hope you enjoy!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Two dozen different characters to recruit and find!! You may recognize some of them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Tons of enemies and bosses to fight hand-drawn by Cesare from Italy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022A digital metric poop ton of armor and weapons to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Traditional turn-based combat with new and clearly superior <strong>Retro Sideview Combat</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Open World Exploration with many maps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Another Dragon Strip Club!! You read that right! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Day/night cycle with the hour, day, week, month and even year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022In-game weather system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Chase events...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p>",
